        <h2>Your five-step pathway to practising in Australia</h2>
        <p>Every doctor&rsquo;s pathway is different. It depends on your qualifications, specialty, country of training and recent practice. Our team maps the requirements specific to you and drives each one to completion.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">1</div><h4>Determine your registration pathway</h4><p>We assess your qualifications, specialty and recent practice to identify the right AHPRA or MCNZ registration pathway and give you a clear plan.</p></div>
        <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">2</div><h4>Confirm your role</h4><p>Already have a job offer? We support the applications linked to your new role. If not, <a href="https://wave.com.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wavelength&rsquo;s medical recruitment team</a> can help you find one.</p></div>
